# THE C22c ONE SOURCE IS DATA, NOT OUTPUT, AND *.json ABOVE WOULD HAVE EATEN IT
# (OC-125). It is the only recording of the six family ceilings
# entropy_floor.py subtracts; the module REFUSES at import if it is absent, so
# committing everything else without it would have left a repository whose
# floor cannot be computed at all -- working perfectly on the machine that
# wrote it. Caught by `git status` not listing it, which is not a check.
!audits/2026-10-11-independent-audit/oracles/c22c_source.json
